Key Live API & Agent Engine Specifications
Feature	Protocol / Format Details	Notebook Implementation Reference
Transport	WebSockets via LlmBidiService/BidiGenerateContent	websockets.asyncio.client.connect using Bearer token auth
Audio Spec	16-bit PCM, Little-Endian, 24kHz sample rate	np.frombuffer(pcm_data, dtype=np.int16) played at rate=24000
Input Payload	client_content with role: "user" & turn_complete: True	Wrapped as ADK LiveRequest(content=Content(parts=[...]))
Output Payload	serverContent -> modelTurn -> parts -> inlineData	Received via async loop, decoded from Base64 to Int16 PCM
Turn Control	serverContent.turnComplete == True	Yielder emits "end of turn" to trigger playback on client

