Code Review & Risk Analysis

    GooglePay.kt: Contains completely empty stubs for both GooglePayButton and GoogleWalletSaveButton.  

    rememberReceiptScanner.kt: Uses GlobalScope.launch, which leaks coroutines if the calling UI unmounts before image scanning completes. It also instantiates ApiClient() inside a thread block without state management or lifecycle caching.  

    main.kt: Uses synchronous window.prompt and window.alert blocking popups inside nested .then Promise chains rather than idiomatic Kotlin suspend coroutines with .await().  

    rememberImagePicker.kt: Iterates through an Int8Array element-by-element using JS interop loops, which causes performance degradation on large image uploads in WasmJS.  

    PlatformTheme.kt: Hardcodes content(null), ignoring native browser system dark mode preferences (prefers-color-scheme).  

