    Inline Type Qualification: ProfileListItem used a fully qualified inline type reference (androidx.compose.ui.graphics.vector.ImageVector) rather than a top-level import.  

    Wildcard Imports: ProfileHeader.kt, ProfileListItem.kt, and ThemeSelectorCard.kt relied on * wildcard imports across Compose layout and Material3 packages.  

