An audit of LiquidGlassCard.kt identified a theme adaptability issue and hardcoded layout padding.  
Code Audit Findings

    Hardcoded White Tint (Color.White): Using hardcoded Color.White.copy(alpha = ...) makes the glass effect invisible when rendered against light background surfaces in Light Mode. Adding an optional glassColor parameter derived from MaterialTheme.colorScheme.surface or MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onSurface ensures theme-aware readability.  

    Hardcoded Content Padding: Hardcoding .padding(16.dp) directly on the root Box prevents callers from specifying edge-to-edge media or custom padding values.  

