An audit of the vision feature package (components.features.vision) identified dead callbacks, duplicated UI nodes, hardcoded checkout addresses, and unused wildcard imports.  

    Dead Checkout Callback (SmartVisionDetectionOverlay.kt): The onHitlCheckout callback parameter was never invoked when tapping the Buy button; the button only dispatched analytics telemetry without triggering the checkout workflow.  

    Duplicated Rating Badge (SmartVisionDetectionOverlay.kt): Star rating badge UI was rendered twice—once manually offset above the container and once inside MediaActionCard's badgeContent slot.  

    Control Binding Overlap (SmartVisionControlsOverlay.kt): All three control buttons (Live Camera, Upload, and Refresh) were hardbound to the same onPickLensImage callback.  

    Hardcoded Shipping Address (SmartVisionPage.kt): Confirmed checkout tokens defaulted to "123 Main St".  

    Dead Wildcard Imports (All Files): Unused import components.models.* declarations were present across multiple files.  

