Audit of the provided wardrobe components revealed several UI state, layout, and color contrast defects.  

    Low Color Contrast Defect (wardrobePhotoGalleryGrid.kt): The badge container used surface.copy(alpha = 0.8f) with surface text color, creating unreadable surface-on-surface text. Replaced with surfaceContainerHigh and onSurfaceVariant.  

    Dead State & Callbacks (WardrobePage.kt & WardrobeHeaderToolbar.kt): WardrobeHeaderToolbar contained an unreferenced onSelectAiGenerator parameter, and WardrobePage never mutated its local photos state after adding items via backend calls.  

    Missing Root Modifiers: WardrobeHeaderToolbar and WardrobePermissionModal lacked root modifier: Modifier = Modifier parameters.  

    Dead Wildcard Imports: Cleaned unused import components.models.* and self-package imports across all files.  

