    Spoofed Biometric Authentication: In HITLCheckoutModal.tsx, calling loginWithGoogle() to simulate biometric/Passkey verification provides zero cryptographic proof of user intent. Attackers can complete purchases without local hardware authentication. Use the standard navigator.credentials.get() (WebAuthn API) for real biometric authorization.  

